From 67100005ac7c6dfabba44778bd3a1e3074666e32 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerard Balaoro <gerardbalaoro@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:35:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(release): label fork nightlies and drop the track switch

This fork publishes one nightly track. Show it as "Gerard" in the window title and sidebar pill, hide the Update track setting and its search entry, stop pointing at that setting from server update hints, and default the install scripts to the nightly train.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
